[{"title":"登南雄塔","author":"庞嵩","text":"玉笋凌千仞，虹轮跨九霄。\n拂衣红日近，回首白云遥。\n树色通阛阆，山光入画描。\n暂同登眺乐，心已在明朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25724,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄黄默斋","author":"庞嵩","text":"一毡怜独冷，九载尚儒官。\n过雨兼时洽，看春易地宽。\n树深云外叶，丹老鼎中丸。\n万里风初厚，天池翮正抟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25725,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄元冈诸老暨子弟","author":"庞嵩","text":"忆别愁多绪，临笺愧懒予。\n椿荆宜肖旧，兰桂近何如。\n鼓棹千江月，传家万卷书。\n紫霄别平地，随意各怡愉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25726,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠张都阃征安南","author":"庞嵩","text":"简书专阃外，节钺出天涯。\n八阵骧龙虎，三驱殪兕豝。\n金瓯元已固，铜柱绩非遐。\n从此安南地，车书大一家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25727,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登文游台","author":"庞嵩","text":"郭野苍茫合，湖山隐映开。\n永怀千古杰，遥上四贤台。\n绕壁看题句，临风数举杯。\n醉归明烛夜，金炬愧非才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25728,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贡院中秋","author":"庞嵩","text":"爽籁金飙发，明河玉辇过。\n秋光怜尔独，古照阅人多。\n笔战犹金鼓，笙歌忆绮罗。\n有人桐影下，笑笑问嫦娥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25729,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十六夜贡院","author":"庞嵩","text":"棘闱夜寂寂，凉月秋涓涓。\n影动三千界，光盈二八前。\n较材归艺圃，聚彩烛金躔。\n皓魄知人好，今宵觉倍圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25730,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"双鹿应期","author":"庞嵩","text":"岳伯分符日，湘江祝寿时。\n两辰开夙燕，双鹿产新儿。\n挟毂占嘉茀，悬铜纪秀眉。\n世南原有赋，谁为缵骚词。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25731,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何檗樵年兄赍表入贺二首。名孟伦 其一","author":"庞嵩","text":"青衫还忆旧，白下更依然。\n解识驰驱范，宁分尺五天。\n雪寒征旆道，日近衮衣前。\n寿粒灵丹在，东南肯借怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25732,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何檗樵年兄赍表入贺二首。名孟伦 其二","author":"庞嵩","text":"淑景开元旦，祥光护玉宸。\n陛墀千丈晓，海宇万年春。\n旧爱惟金鉴，孤忠有棘臣。\n炉烟回合处，喜气正鲜新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25733,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访喜庵偶忆章斗阳","author":"庞嵩","text":"署判南京兆，遥思章斗阳。\n蜀高山月白，吴阔树云苍。\n陋巷时方乐，过门心正忙。\n何当风雨夜，兰刹复联床。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25734,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游寺","author":"庞嵩","text":"洞僻烟萝古，山回涧竹幽。\n小桥双岛合，深径落霞收。\n玉井莲长夏，金飙树早秋。\n梧空潭影静，身世亦虚舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25735,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游上温泉次李白夫韵","author":"庞嵩","text":"温泉移旧地，高赏复同君。\n野曲乘流渡，空箫隔洞闻。\n韶光将到律，暝色欲留云。\n斗酒欣良夕，何妨更论文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25736,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游白云洞","author":"庞嵩","text":"路旁吼狮子，洞门隐伽佛。\n既登崇明台，直探玄虚窟。\n滴溜悬黍珠，玉田养丹粒。\n试问乔与松，如何永呼吸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25737,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游青莲洞","author":"庞嵩","text":"紫府隔人寰，青莲偶共扳。\n鱼凫归瞬睫，乌兔迭双圜。\n仰眺天通窟，穷探洞转湾。\n达摩犹面壁，何日锡飞还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25738,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为与崖题","author":"庞嵩","text":"绝壁孤根起，中天积翠浮。\n看春谁是伴，伐木故相求。\n路入寒云湿，窗涵晚壑秋。\n耽山吾有癖，还尔共傲浮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25739,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋郊喜稼","author":"庞嵩","text":"出郭凌风眺，沿郊趁晚凉。\n凄枫惊落叶，彧稌游成行。\n溉釜需燎急，催租走檄忙。\n万方今有喜，逋待得新偿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25740,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄陈右洲","author":"庞嵩","text":"我爱右洲子，相怀隔曲湄。\n汀葭秋水合，村树晚云移。\n砚榻交情在，琴樽逸兴驰。\n何当频缩地，细与话心期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25741,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"观鱼","author":"庞嵩","text":"观生观我得，适意且观鱼。\n泳跃心何有，浮沉体自虚。\n忘机常罢钓，到倦总抛书。\n一曲沧浪调，闻之亦起余。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25742,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"有所思","author":"庞嵩","text":"揽衾起中夜，抱膝故沉吟。\n未了心头话，谁拈指上琴。\n去云天共远，来月夜同深。\n何物凭消遣，惟应酒自斟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25743,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"静院闻莺","author":"庞嵩","text":"城隅真隐地，扫迹远逃名。\n坐到嚣尘寂，忽闻莺鸟鸣。\n金梭随柳转，玉律细风迎。\n宛奏咸和曲，浑疑广莫行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25744,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"久旱","author":"庞嵩","text":"八月已无雨，冬来尚熯云。\n硕苗含稿穗，遐土尽焦焚。\n作旱疑凶寇，荒年岂大军。\n欲赓云汉什，何以慰民勤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"端阳后二日","author":"庞嵩","text":"龙斗江中息，渔歌泽上苏。\n盘堆仍角黍，杯沥带菖蒲。\n月向将弦上，风从隔竹呼。\n池亭欣避暑，谁复吊湘无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跃鱼二首 其一","author":"庞嵩","text":"槛外閒窥沼，水深多纵鳞。\n升沉原自性，游跃故相亲。\n洗砚吞吐墨，忘机罢钓纶。\n畏途风已静，吾亦水云身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"跃鱼二首 其二","author":"庞嵩","text":"入境诸天寂，跃鱼时在津。\n岂因琴出听，应罢钓来驯。\n鬣破龙门锦，波翻禹浪银。\n济时云雨具，应与后生论。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十一日山中见月","author":"庞嵩","text":"元宵开此夕，里社始悬灯。\n岂识常明照，还当最上层。\n清光瞻兔腹，梵语净伽楞。\n适意归吟弄，逍遥寄大鹏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"白泉诗为戴知事","author":"庞嵩","text":"瑶池分玉液，流出绩溪东。\n月漱晶光满，山涵镜彩融。\n建庵遗竹圃，启院有花封。\n一派渊源远，盈科与海通。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登楼对雨","author":"庞嵩","text":"四峰雷送雨，短袷怯春寒。\n遣兴偏宜酒，凭虚共倚栏。\n泉声和涧底，树色隐云端。\n喜得看山伴，阴晴总壮观。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过小金山登妙高台","author":"庞嵩","text":"自惜驰驱地，遨游今独閒。\n不因筵祖道，已破利名关。\n适意鸢鱼外，忘形天地间。\n德云苏老逝，休更问回环。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"兜率庵题宦林天聚亭壁","author":"庞嵩","text":"高山盘郁处，兜率古禅庵。\n两壁悬清溜，诸峰拥翠岚。\n德星人几聚，奇迹我幽探。\n缱绻欲留带，高僧谁共谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南台寺","author":"庞嵩","text":"石径缘兜率，肩舆憩此台。\n南轩遗句在，北斗暮云开。\n百级阶前迥，千峰岭后摧。\n登临无限意，天霁约重来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊汉川镇","author":"庞嵩","text":"汉左云连岸，郧阳月到船。\n棹歌聊劝酒，灯夕此开筵。\n绮阁辉银烛，琼楼沸玉弦。\n五羊东一望，凄况泬寥天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和云洞即事","author":"庞嵩","text":"舞雩多夙伴，半月共云林。\n远眺天空眼，长吟月在襟。\n百年真此乐，千里祇同心。\n不有知音者，谁为浪鼓琴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"为黎东湖","author":"庞嵩","text":"震泽波翻定，层轩敞户楹。\n春来先着暖，日出早生明。\n地胜人同杰，孙贤祖有声。\n千年遗泽在，新沐振朝缨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"番山秋色二首 其一","author":"庞嵩","text":"雄藩罗岭海，突兀建宫墙。\n首善同文地，殊方会极场。\n阙林连拱秀，台斗焕文光。\n引步看秋色，庭槐已报黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"番山秋色二首 其二","author":"庞嵩","text":"百粤风光丽，三城秋倍妍。\n祥云连粉堞，皎月耀晴天。\n水播鲲翎变，花明骥足先。\n河南原有谶，重见辂生鞭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"三约邝五岭丈不至","author":"庞嵩","text":"美人违去久，杳杳隔芙南。\n青鸟岂无信，白鹅空有潭。\n樽开三度醉，赋辍几玄谈。\n树色秋光暮，临风意每含。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"洞宾图","author":"庞嵩","text":"野服囊孤剑，飘萧世外游。\n浮名几欲误，初服返真修。\n已蜕苍龙骨，时登黄鹤楼。\n洞庭明月夜，一啸碧天秋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山漫兴 其一","author":"周孚先","text":"半亩潮田云外陇，一区蔬圃水中洲。\n蓑衣犁透桃花雨，扣角无人问饭牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山漫兴 其三","author":"周孚先","text":"天际罗帆诗景多，更添诗思入晴波。\n桥边月涌鱼翻藻，亭外风掀鹭闪荷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山漫兴 其二","author":"周孚先","text":"竹径茅庐是我家，三湾流水半溪沙。\n疏慵镇日浑无事，一灶秋云煮菊花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西山漫兴 其四","author":"周孚先","text":"万籁无声山更幽，一泉绕屋石中流。\n才闻鹤向云间度，风送梨花上枕头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纪文丞相入潮遗事","author":"林大春","text":"王气萧条向北都，犹勤天讨下蓬壶。\n江舟不解荆胥剑，南国空传蜀相图。\n古庙青觞灵马伏，野桥芳草白麟孤。\n谁知一别厓门震，楚水燕山恨未苏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"离山书院钟铭","author":"薛侃","text":"晨昏二十四敲钟，声彻前峰并后峰。\n试问岩岩诸学士，已闻曾与未闻同？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"朔州道","author":"翁万达","text":"柳枝侵夏意仍怯，山麓出泉寒不流。\n我已十年穿虎窟，地今四月尚狐裘。\n思乡路远频挥泪，报主身轻何所忧。\n不惜千金求死士，雕戈直向古丰州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"旅馆秋日怀旧隐 其二","author":"萧端蒙","text":"此日东篱菊放时，故人怀我正裁诗。\n玄晖疑有春池梦，潘岳应多秋兴词。\n汐落沧洲鲳鳜晚，霜寒梅岭橘橙迟。\n遥思清夜山阳会，玉笛声残月未移。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词四首 其一","author":"萧端蒙","text":"良家初入未承恩，谩著罗襦锦凤纹。\n独向深宫倍萧瑟，不知何处望春云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戊午除夕","author":"林熙春","text":"屈指当年惊戊午，今年戊午益堪伤。\n甘泉烽火三韩急，濒海风涛八月狂。\n复以梧摧增涕泪，更于星变转仓皇。\n幸当此夕销除尽，坐待明朝瑞气翔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"八月初四日纪事二首 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"成仁取义忆前贤，异代同心几自鞭。\n血比苌弘新化碧，魂依望帝久为鹃。\n曾无尺寸酬高厚，惟有孤丹照简篇。\n万卷诗书随一炬，千秋霜管俟他年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王师以季秋晦拔高明冀露布遂达行畿十绝 其七","author":"郭之奇","text":"千年雪耻事何如，十载人寰气颇舒。\n已向羊城收狡窟，更从龙塞觅狼居。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中答邑令二首 其一","author":"罗万杰","text":"竹马迎来冬日温，条风远拂陇头村。\n首阳亦属周疆里，敢道食薇不是恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中答邑令二首 其二","author":"罗万杰","text":"一扫浮氛今已清，几家鸡犬月中行。\n道人只合孤峰顶，卧听康衢击壤声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斋居二首 其二","author":"林大钦","text":"斗室行藏卧起徐，飘飖久矣白云居。\n世远桑麻乔木里，情閒风月短蓑馀。\n谢安不倦登临兴，阮籍真忘礼法疏。\n惆怅哲人今寂寞，孤吟搔首思踌躇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其一","author":"郭之奇","text":"丘壑方求位置，烟霞遂结居诸。\n莫云此日关闭，茅径今朝手锄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其二","author":"郭之奇","text":"有意林泉自得，忘机鱼鸟相和。\n八千里外藏迹，一勺堂中啸歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其三","author":"郭之奇","text":"回首风尘暂息，考槃寤寐相甘。\n试看云物如昨，始信劳人太憨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其四","author":"郭之奇","text":"东山随地堪作，人境结庐未喧。\n苔径孤宜折屐，荆篱自止高轩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其五","author":"郭之奇","text":"数卷图书作主，三春花鸟为邻。\n其馀无复长物，此内况容俗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事二十首 其六","author":"郭之奇","text":"在水之中构室，开窗于此高眠。\n何知汉与魏晋，自谓无忧葛天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其七","author":"郭之奇","text":"千林秋色回薄，四壁寒声悄然。\n晨起登楼眺远，苍苍满目飞烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其八","author":"郭之奇","text":"寒月空庭夜影，落梅满砌霜华。\n岭南白雪稀少，欲问阳春此花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其九","author":"郭之奇","text":"秦地渔津日杳，漆园蝶梦时生。\n非关与世殊俗，聊亦从吾素盟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十","author":"郭之奇","text":"盆花次第依令，园果后先得时。\n物物深情可见，年年好景须思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十一","author":"郭之奇","text":"晓树临风骤舞，昏潮带月潜来。\n忘言独对终日，静掩柴扉不开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十二","author":"郭之奇","text":"酒熟惟思座上，花开移置阶前。\n有时少长咸集，几度幽人未眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十三","author":"郭之奇","text":"日落榕阴翠匝，风摇兰径芳微。\n梦蝴枕上初觉，啼鸟枝头未归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十四","author":"郭之奇","text":"雨过忽变芳草，潮退时翻落花。\n清景当前屡易，浮生此际何涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十五","author":"郭之奇","text":"习静因知得力，逃禅本觉无心。\n朔望一变潮汐，今古随流浅深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十六","author":"郭之奇","text":"髀肉经时易满，剑光每夜难韬。\n独惭纸上青汗，空付床头白醪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十七","author":"郭之奇","text":"执戟多年倦客，步兵累岁閒身。\n草玄独俟知己，眼白相看世人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其十八","author":"郭之奇","text":"何须问众清浊，且自观心逸劳。\n在我应从古制，于人合让时豪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事二十首 其十九","author":"郭之奇","text":"屈指粤东名丛，曲江南海瑶山。\n斯文未丧今日，后死谁人可班？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宛在堂中即事 其二十","author":"郭之奇","text":"一往深情诵读，半生乐事诗书。\n承明著作还彼，百代风骚待予。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":25796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]